r lives  alternatively you could try my ebook and  training program super functional  training  the super functional program is designed  to increase performance across the board  from cognitive function to speed to  strength and there's a discount on right  now  while we're all dealing with the  pandemic subscribe of course if you'd  like to see more like this  and thanks a ton for watching this one  see you next time  and bye for now  [Music]  [Music]  oh  [Music]  oh  [Laughter]

